1340:- `LOGICAL_LANE_TARGET = READY_INDEPENDENT_DELIVERABLES`; actual worker concurrency is `min(logical lanes, worker slots)`. Insufficient slots create waves, not fake dependencies or merged independent nodes. No A4A/A4B/A4C definition was found in the inspected authority, so retain uncertainty until the project SSOT is supplied [Task 1]
1341-- OpenClaw can use ChatGPT/Codex OAuth, maintains server-side SQLite session/transcript state at `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/agent/openclaw-agent.sqlite`, and reuses a Gateway session through the same `user` or `x-openclaw-session-key`. Embedded OpenClaw owns its canonical transcript; the Codex app-server runtime owns its native thread and OpenClaw mirrors it [Task 2]
