agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-review-lanes/returns/A4-replay-retry.md:8:  finding: Restart compares only manual_id values and checks reconstructed budget equality. It does not bind the complete manual-queue entries to the persisted archive, so a queue entry can retain the same manual_id while its reason, detail, cursor, topic_id, or input_id is changed and still pass. This also leaves persisted replay state only partially revalidated.
